   1390  f2a4							; --- Signed whole-pixel displacement this frame = carry + vyHi. ---
   1391  f2a4							;     Respawn hover (bugs.md #1) runs HERE so every velocity path reaches it
   1392  f2a4							;     (the clamp above `jmp .Integrate`s past anything placed earlier). While
   1393  f2a4							;     Hover is set, pin Y (vy=0, no fall) but let the jet ramp run; once thrust
   1394  f2a4							;     can beat gravity (JetPower >= GRAVITY+1) clear it and normal physics
