   3636  fc8a							; PCH, and ReturnPad's rts popped ($00<<8|BombX)+1 = $009A -> ZP
   3637  fc8a							; executed as code -> $F008 pad -> GameStart REBOOT to title (the
   3638  fc8a							; SIM_EXIT=down f265 296-line crash frame + the title-264 family).
