   3745  fcc1							; DropArm / DropStep — the ONE spawn drop-in (user rule: same code for every
   3746  fcc1							; restart, only the destiny X/Y changes — X is already in RoomX, placed by the
   3747  fcc1							; caller; Y is animated from the screen top down to it).
   3748  fcc1							; Triggers: stage start / game over / level advance (LoadLevel tail),
   3749  fcc1							; enemy/blast/timer/hot death (.LLStay, same position), water (LoseLifeBand,
   3750  fcc1							; Y-12). All tail-call it -> zero added stack depth (sim_bomb_fuse guard).
   3751  fcc1							;
   3752  fcc1							; DropArm (A implied = current RoomY, C=0 out): freezes RoomY as DropTarget,
   3753  fcc1							; starts the sprite at the top (RoomY=0), zeroes physics + laser state so
   3754  fcc1							; descent is clean (LaserInput is skipped by the gate; beam gate forced 0).
   3755  fcc1							;
   3756  fcc1							; DropStep (runs instead of input/physics/collision while DropTarget != 0):
   3757  fcc1							; 8.8 accumulator PlayerYSub += DropSpeedTable[DropTarget>>4]; carry ->
   3758  fcc1							; inc RoomY; arrival (RoomY >= DropTarget) -> DropTarget = 0, normal control
   3759  fcc1							; resumes next frame. Speed table = Y*256/(60+Y/2) sampled per 16px tier ->
   3760  fcc1							; fall lasts ~60+Y/2 frames = 1.0-2.2 s (shallow start = quicker arrival).
   3761  fcc1							; Tail-jumps to OverscanAudio: bomb/laser/input/physics/horizontal/hot/band/
   3762  fcc1							; miner/enemy-hit/BombTick are all bypassed (enemies + bombs frozen 1-2 s,
   3763  fcc1							; timer keeps running; bank1 UpdateJetSound hears DropTarget as throttle).
   3764  fcc1							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
