   4060  fe00							; BandStart — first scanline of bands 0..3 (moved here 2026-10-22: the
   4061  fe00							; $F744 fill was 4 B over after the type-mask fix; this fill is free and
   4062  fe00							; `cmp BandStart,X` is abs,X, so the address is irrelevant — low byte
