   4233  fe90							; ObjColorTab — per-scanline GRP1 object colors, stride 8 = ObjSprites
   4234  fe90							; stride; indexed by the same X = ObjBase + r in .Grp1 at $FE00 (4c, same
   4235  fe90							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
   4236  fe90							; per OBJ_* slot: type color x8 (matches EnemyColorTable /
   4237  fe90							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   4238  fe90							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
